For awareness only: A briefing on the published examination priorities for =
the coming year is scheduled for Boston staff. The session covers the areas=
 of focus, the expected mix of scoped and full-scope examinations, and how =
the priorities feed the candidate list. Attendance is expected for all exam=
ination staff and the materials will be posted afterward. Raise it with me =
rather than with the branch directly.